# BUG (QA E3): softlock in the Festungsbahn pit of 00_enemies.
# enemies_festungsbahn_ride up to the plateau (1237), on to x 1702 (the
# camera follows to 1564 and never scrolls back), then back left: the
# plateau edge (x 1584) is on screen, she walks off it and falls into the
# pit (lands at 1562, x 1564, y 186). From there nothing gets her out:
# - the pit wall up to the plateau is 6 tiles, higher than any jump;
# - she can't walk left of the camera (1564) to where the car comes down;
# - from x >= ~1533 the car's top is out of jump reach along its whole
#   track (it is only that far right when it is high up);
# - and the car itself was despawned at ~1400 (left of camera - 64), so it
#   never comes back anyway.
# Only time-up ends it. Design (Festungsbahn): "falling off means waiting
# for the car, never death"; here it is not even death, it's a softlock.
# Expected (this file): she is not stuck below the plateau - i.e. she
# can't drop back into the pit once the camera has passed it (then these
# inputs leave her on the plateau, y 90). If the fix is a different one
# (e.g. the pit gets a way back up), adapt the escape inputs at the end.
level  = enemies
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = deaths=0 player_y<=90
---
R 80
RJ 12
R 60
R 140
RJ 20
R 62
RJ 16
R 161
RJ 20
R 274
RJ 20
R 4
- 130
R 20      # onto the car
- 175     # ride up
R 104     # onto the plateau and on to x 1702 (camera 1564)
- 140
L 100     # back left: off the plateau edge into the pit (1562)
- 600     # wait for the car: it never comes
